WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
[Press machinery]

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.839
History has a pulse. Listen.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:12.783
In seventeen seventy-six, the Declaration entered a print shop.
The words had to reach the people.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.748
A working draft. A printed sheet. A voice, carried farther.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.075
The inheritance reaches beyond the founding.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.798
The search for wisdom.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.290
The call to mercy.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.522
The courage to find our way.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.408
Here in Austin, we give enduring words a place on the page.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:50.103
Ink. Paper. A working press. A tradition, carried forward.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.964
Read the words. Keep the source. Make room for the enduring.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.734
Thomas Broadside Company. Build something that lasts.
